(5954554, 869338, 106349, '<td valign="top">Love the little face on the balloon!</td>', 'Love the little face on the balloon!', '2010-04-19 07:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954556, 867805, 106349, '<td valign="top">Freakin'' hilarious. Good job!</td>', 'Freakin'' hilarious. Good job!', '2010-04-19 07:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954560, 868695, 46314, '<td valign="top">Stopped motion balloon burst #3: I find the hands a bit distracting. Maybe there was a way to pose them without placing so much emphasis on them?</td>', 'Stopped motion balloon burst #3: I find the hands a bit distracting. Maybe there was a way to pose them without placing so much emphasis on them?', '2010-04-19 08:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954562, 867874, 46314, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, a water balloon that''s not bursting open in stopped-motion photography: that''s original :-)</td>', 'Hmmm, a water balloon that''s not bursting open in stopped-motion photography: that''s original :-)', '2010-04-19 08:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954565, 870084, 46314, '<td valign="top">Danny Deckchair. I love it. The composition and setting are terrific. I love the dark line of the mountain range, and the muted tones of the desert floor which contrast the burst of brightly coloured balloons. Nice detail with the flight gear. One of my favourites so far.</td>', 'Danny Deckchair. I love it. The composition and setting are terrific. I love the dark line of the mountain range, and the muted tones of the desert floor which contrast the burst of brightly coloured balloons. Nice detail with the flight gear. One of my favourites so far.', '2010-04-19 08:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954569, 868928, 46314, '<td valign="top">I''m fairly certain both the dog and the teddy have posed for better photos.</td>', 'I''m fairly certain both the dog and the teddy have posed for better photos.', '2010-04-19 08:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954570, 869645, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice abstract.', '2010-04-19 08:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954571, 869977, 103048, '<td valign="top">Very good. 8</td>', 'Very good. 8', '2010-04-19 08:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954572, 867858, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice idea and good post-processing, but not the best POV you used</td>', 'nice idea and good post-processing, but not the best POV you used', '2010-04-19 08:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954573, 870158, 46314, '<td valign="top">Clever concept. But could have been much better on a dark background with a light behind the balloon so that it was actually lit up.</td>', 'Clever concept. But could have been much better on a dark background with a light behind the balloon so that it was actually lit up.', '2010-04-19 08:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954574, 868643, 46314, '<td valign="top">I like the way the various subjects (swan and balloons) lead the eye upwards like stepping stones.</td>', 'I like the way the various subjects (swan and balloons) lead the eye upwards like stepping stones.', '2010-04-19 08:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954578, 868571, 46314, '<td valign="top">Stopped motion balloon burst #1: This is a good capture.</td>', 'Stopped motion balloon burst #1: This is a good capture.', '2010-04-19 08:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954580, 869190, 46314, '<td valign="top">I wonder why she looks so sad? She got the balloons didn''t she? Maybe she wants to grow up to be in one of those goth-girl balloon photos with the black balloons...</td>', 'I wonder why she looks so sad? She got the balloons didn''t she? Maybe she wants to grow up to be in one of those goth-girl balloon photos with the black balloons...', '2010-04-19 08:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954584, 867694, 49109, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, I like the color contrasting with the "chalkboard" surface; unforzunately loads of sharpening artefacts visible, especially in the wrinkles of her dress and around her body and the balloons - while other parts (foot, hair) seem to be blurred. The border doesn''t add here.</td>', 'Creative idea, I like the color contrasting with the "chalkboard" surface; unforzunately loads of sharpening artefacts visible, especially in the wrinkles of her dress and around her body and the balloons - while other parts (foot, hair) seem to be blurred. The border doesn''t add here.', '2010-04-19 08:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954585, 870133, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great abstract. Nice control of the tone.</td>', 'Great abstract. Nice control of the tone.', '2010-04-19 08:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954589, 869270, 49109, '<td valign="top">simple yet effective :)</td>', 'simple yet effective :)', '2010-04-19 08:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954593, 868148, 46314, '<td valign="top">There''s something about the processing that I don''t like on this one. Maybe it''s the black fringes around the clouds: aren''t they supposed to have a sliver lining?</td>', 'There''s something about the processing that I don''t like on this one. Maybe it''s the black fringes around the clouds: aren''t they supposed to have a sliver lining?', '2010-04-19 08:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954595, 868875, 46314, '<td valign="top">But cheer up kid... at least you got to take the balloons home with you!</td>', 'But cheer up kid... at least you got to take the balloons home with you!', '2010-04-19 08:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954599, 869946, 46314, '<td valign="top">Stopped motion balloon burst #4: cleanup on aisle 3!</td>', 'Stopped motion balloon burst #4: cleanup on aisle 3!', '2010-04-19 08:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954600, 867995, 46314, '<td valign="top">Mark Poppins. Nice composition.</td>', 'Mark Poppins. Nice composition.', '2010-04-19 08:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954602, 869099, 49109, '<td valign="top">creative idea, excellent lighting and well composed</td>', 'creative idea, excellent lighting and well composed', '2010-04-19 08:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5954606, 869442, 46314, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the blurry edges, and the composition just doesn''t emphasise the balloon enough to carry the concept.</td>', 'I don''t like the blurry edges, and the composition just doesn''t emphasise the balloon enough to carry the concept.', '2010-04-19 08:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
