(5955604, 869190, 52336, '<td valign="top">That''s an absolutely beautiful photo.  What a great photograph, compositionally, your brilliant colour choices, and everything else.  It reminds me of a lovely spare piece of music by Brian Eno called "Bloom", on the CD "Drawn From Life".  The music is quiet and beautiful (like this photo), but it''s made all the more lovely because you can hear Eno and his two young daughters chatting quietly about breakfast and helicopters and peas porridge, and other things.  Thanks for this fantastic photo, 9.</td>', 'That''s an absolutely beautiful photo.  What a great photograph, compositionally, your brilliant colour choices, and everything else.  It reminds me of a lovely spare piece of music by Brian Eno called "Bloom", on the CD "Drawn From Life".  The music is quiet and beautiful (like this photo), but it''s made all the more lovely because you can hear Eno and his two young daughters chatting quietly about breakfast and helicopters and peas porridge, and other things.  Thanks for this fantastic photo, 9.', '2010-04-19 13:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5955605, 869412, 52336, '<td valign="top">Kind of weird for the sake of weird, but well done.  One of the few examples where selective desat works well.  Nice. 8</td>', 'Kind of weird for the sake of weird, but well done.  One of the few examples where selective desat works well.  Nice. 8', '2010-04-19 13:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
