(5955611, 870171, 104230, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the execution. Great model!  However, I think your choice of color for the border detracts rather than adds.</td>', 'I love the idea and the execution. Great model!  However, I think your choice of color for the border detracts rather than adds.', '2010-04-19 13:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5955613, 868599, 116832, '<td valign="top">winner!!!!!</td>', 'winner!!!!!', '2010-04-19 13:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5955614, 869063, 52336, '<td valign="top">Perfect portrait in terms of light, comp, tone, colour.  The balloon is an afterthought.  Thanks for that. 9</td>', 'Perfect portrait in terms of light, comp, tone, colour.  The balloon is an afterthought.  Thanks for that. 9', '2010-04-19 13:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5955615, 869334, 52336, '<td valign="top">Looks like a tribute to Jan von Holleben.  Nicely done.  Would have worked even better against a textured background, on the ground somewhere, in a natural setting, like his.  This is good though. 8</td>', 'Looks like a tribute to Jan von Holleben.  Nicely done.  Would have worked even better against a textured background, on the ground somewhere, in a natural setting, like his.  This is good though. 8', '2010-04-19 13:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5955670, 868003, 104230, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  I just love this idea, especially the use of different sized balloons in addition to different colors.  I recognize that the flatness of the balloons themselves is the result of the luminous back lighting, but the result doesn''t feel quite right. I suspect this resulted from ramping up the saturation and thus blocking out any delicate tonal gradations that existed.</td>', 'Very creative.  I just love this idea, especially the use of different sized balloons in addition to different colors.  I recognize that the flatness of the balloons themselves is the result of the luminous back lighting, but the result doesn''t feel quite right. I suspect this resulted from ramping up the saturation and thus blocking out any delicate tonal gradations that existed.', '2010-04-19 14:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5955693, 869787, 72670, '<td valign="top">A little disturbing, but refreshing to see this on this site. Hope the voters are kind.</td>', 'A little disturbing, but refreshing to see this on this site. Hope the voters are kind.', '2010-04-19 14:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5955698, 870141, 80087, '<td valign="top">Nice shot what a unique idea!!! How cute was this and it looked like fun</td>', 'Nice shot what a unique idea!!! How cute was this and it looked like fun', '2010-04-19 14:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5955699, 867499, 72670, '<td valign="top">Great image! I wonder if the lower balloon had been falling it would suit the title more. 8</td>', 'Great image! I wonder if the lower balloon had been falling it would suit the title more. 8', '2010-04-19 14:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
