(5955948, 869113, 113419, '<td valign="top">I think this is the beginning of a beautiful photograph.....i would like to see the model a littler further away from the ballons....laying on her side....one hand stretched toward the ballons, the other hand at her eyes, with the skirt flowing away from her....wait!  why didn''t I do that on my own shoot?  ;-)</td>', 'I think this is the beginning of a beautiful photograph.....i would like to see the model a littler further away from the ballons....laying on her side....one hand stretched toward the ballons, the other hand at her eyes, with the skirt flowing away from her....wait!  why didn''t I do that on my own shoot?  ;-)', '2010-04-19 15:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
