(5956511, 867858, 57775, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo and I love the idea.  It would have been great to see your model''s face, and because she''s lying on the ground it would have been cool to make it seem more like she''s flying by zooming out more and allowing more space beneath her feet.  Great photo though.  7.</td>', 'This is a great photo and I love the idea.  It would have been great to see your model''s face, and because she''s lying on the ground it would have been cool to make it seem more like she''s flying by zooming out more and allowing more space beneath her feet.  Great photo though.  7.', '2010-04-19 21:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
