(5956587, 870109, 57447, '<td valign="top">Interesting exposure on your entry.</td>', 'Interesting exposure on your entry.', '2010-04-19 22:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956589, 869917, 61971, '<td valign="top">This was a nice unique idea. I think execution could have been better. There is an overall color cast that makes this look too pink. Also, if you pull the subjects away from the wall a bit you can help get less shadows and also have the wall look more like a back drop and less like a wall. After that I would say brighten it up a bit and maybe even see how you like it with a black and white conversion.</td>', 'This was a nice unique idea. I think execution could have been better. There is an overall color cast that makes this look too pink. Also, if you pull the subjects away from the wall a bit you can help get less shadows and also have the wall look more like a back drop and less like a wall. After that I would say brighten it up a bit and maybe even see how you like it with a black and white conversion.', '2010-04-19 22:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956590, 869066, 54446, '<td valign="top">Aimed at your DPL team, perhaps.</td>', 'Aimed at your DPL team, perhaps.', '2010-04-19 22:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956595, 867801, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity and the texture you can see on the surface. I like the red, but I feel that the green in the balloon could have been adjusted to compliment it more and brighten it up a bit.</td>', 'I like the clarity and the texture you can see on the surface. I like the red, but I feel that the green in the balloon could have been adjusted to compliment it more and brighten it up a bit.', '2010-04-19 22:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956600, 869746, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced, I think I would like to see more saturated color.</td>', 'Nicely balanced, I think I would like to see more saturated color.', '2010-04-19 22:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956602, 869645, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the dof between the purple balloon and the other balloons. It looks weird to me though as if it is wet. imo the bowtie part could be a little more in focus.</td>', 'I like the dof between the purple balloon and the other balloons. It looks weird to me though as if it is wet. imo the bowtie part could be a little more in focus.', '2010-04-19 22:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956604, 869435, 69246, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2010-04-19 22:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956607, 869858, 57447, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured the expression on his face.</td>', 'I like how you captured the expression on his face.', '2010-04-19 22:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956613, 869461, 37845, '<td valign="top">This looks like a slippy photo. Might just be gross enough to become a DPC classic... like fotomans ''Got Cheese'' shot.</td>', 'This looks like a slippy photo. Might just be gross enough to become a DPC classic... like fotomans ''Got Cheese'' shot.', '2010-04-19 22:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956614, 869066, 61971, '<td valign="top">Well, I am not big on this photo for a few reasons. (aside from the subject matter). The lighting could have been done to brighten up both sides of the balloon and get rid of that funky grey/green/blackish grain that makes up the shadows. The background right side has some distracting highlights in it that pull my eye away from the subject too.</td>', 'Well, I am not big on this photo for a few reasons. (aside from the subject matter). The lighting could have been done to brighten up both sides of the balloon and get rid of that funky grey/green/blackish grain that makes up the shadows. The background right side has some distracting highlights in it that pull my eye away from the subject too.', '2010-04-19 22:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956626, 869868, 61971, '<td valign="top">I know this is trying to be lighthearted and funny, I guess it just didn''t hit my funny bone. Shots a little dark and busy for me. Cute idea though.</td>', 'I know this is trying to be lighthearted and funny, I guess it just didn''t hit my funny bone. Shots a little dark and busy for me. Cute idea though.', '2010-04-19 22:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956627, 870156, 12796, '<td valign="top">isn''t this a stress ball? Not exactly a balloon.</td>', 'isn''t this a stress ball? Not exactly a balloon.', '2010-04-19 22:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956634, 869562, 12796, '<td valign="top">reminds me of an IreneM Zen shot</td>', 'reminds me of an IreneM Zen shot', '2010-04-19 22:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956650, 869435, 12796, '<td valign="top">wrong model to go with the balloon. he looks like a rough and tough guy. very little significance with a balloon.</td>', 'wrong model to go with the balloon. he looks like a rough and tough guy. very little significance with a balloon.', '2010-04-19 22:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956655, 869063, 16106, '<td valign="top">I wish you had been able to get this lovely light AND had the balloon featured in the foreground. It is a beauiful image and a great idea, but having the balloon so marginalized in the back corner it knocks down what should have been a knock out.</td>', 'I wish you had been able to get this lovely light AND had the balloon featured in the foreground. It is a beauiful image and a great idea, but having the balloon so marginalized in the back corner it knocks down what should have been a knock out.', '2010-04-19 22:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956664, 868998, 12796, '<td valign="top">glares on the glass is terribly distracting. nice idea though</td>', 'glares on the glass is terribly distracting. nice idea though', '2010-04-19 22:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956667, 868067, 16106, '<td valign="top">a very clever idea, fresh and original, well executed and the way the arcs combine present a strong graphic image.</td>', 'a very clever idea, fresh and original, well executed and the way the arcs combine present a strong graphic image.', '2010-04-19 22:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956672, 869868, 94235, '<td valign="top">How do we know these are balloons? Nice thinking.  :-)</td>', 'How do we know these are balloons? Nice thinking.  :-)', '2010-04-19 22:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956673, 869034, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good simple shot but needs a little sharper focus.</td>', 'Good simple shot but needs a little sharper focus.', '2010-04-19 22:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956678, 869714, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice take. Would like to have seen the shot without the shadows</td>', 'Nice take. Would like to have seen the shot without the shadows', '2010-04-19 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956679, 869611, 16106, '<td valign="top">An elegant simplicity in my personal top ten, but I expect it will be more likely to be recognized by Postumous than popular vote</td>', 'An elegant simplicity in my personal top ten, but I expect it will be more likely to be recognized by Postumous than popular vote', '2010-04-19 22:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956680, 868654, 94235, '<td valign="top">The effect of the drop is lost a little with the right side being so dark. Good simple idea all the same.</td>', 'The effect of the drop is lost a little with the right side being so dark. Good simple idea all the same.', '2010-04-19 22:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
