(5956722, 870109, 51597, '<td valign="top">Great Presentation!  Clever thinking b/w makes this POP!!   = 10</td>', 'Great Presentation!  Clever thinking b/w makes this POP!!   = 10', '2010-04-19 23:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956736, 869235, 51597, '<td valign="top">Well done!!</td>', 'Well done!!', '2010-04-19 23:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956737, 868019, 94815, '<td valign="top">Quite an impact - very expressionistic. Too bad so few have the vision (me included). Minor technical problem with halos around the girl and the crop - adjustment will enhance impact to my eye: try trimming off the right so the hand is dead center. Still great for the topic - my only 9 and should win except for the foregoing.</td>', 'Quite an impact - very expressionistic. Too bad so few have the vision (me included). Minor technical problem with halos around the girl and the crop - adjustment will enhance impact to my eye: try trimming off the right so the hand is dead center. Still great for the topic - my only 9 and should win except for the foregoing.', '2010-04-19 23:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
