(5956809, 870168, 61971, '<td valign="top">This is a different find for balloons. I feel like there is a lot of noise in the color especially on the shadowed side.</td>', 'This is a different find for balloons. I feel like there is a lot of noise in the color especially on the shadowed side.', '2010-04-19 23:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956815, 869721, 25313, '<td valign="top">pasty but works!</td>', 'pasty but works!', '2010-04-19 23:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956816, 869999, 28882, '<td valign="top">great idea and model, but i think the girl needs to be more in focus.  I know the balloon is the main subject but when you include the eyes of the model you bring another strong subject in to play.  maybe a crop just above the cheekbone leaving out the eyes and top of the head.</td>', 'great idea and model, but i think the girl needs to be more in focus.  I know the balloon is the main subject but when you include the eyes of the model you bring another strong subject in to play.  maybe a crop just above the cheekbone leaving out the eyes and top of the head.', '2010-04-19 23:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956817, 869995, 61971, '<td valign="top">this feels a little dark to me. I wish that there was a strong focal point to the photo. A little lighter though and this would be perfect for one of the "find the differences" photo puzzles (which I am addicted to) :)</td>', 'this feels a little dark to me. I wish that there was a strong focal point to the photo. A little lighter though and this would be perfect for one of the "find the differences" photo puzzles (which I am addicted to) :)', '2010-04-19 23:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956819, 869461, 25313, '<td valign="top">i''m giving you a ten for special effects.</td>', 'i''m giving you a ten for special effects.', '2010-04-19 23:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956820, 870016, 28882, '<td valign="top">nicely done.</td>', 'nicely done.', '2010-04-19 23:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956822, 868535, 28882, '<td valign="top">creative idea.  i like it.</td>', 'creative idea.  i like it.', '2010-04-19 23:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956824, 869420, 25313, '<td valign="top">very nice 7</td>', 'very nice 7', '2010-04-19 23:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956827, 868148, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the balloon since we usually see yellow smileys so the red is a cool change. The sky looks more like a picture of sky instead of an actual sky, and its too blurry imo. It also looks like you burned in some spots on the clouds and got some of that burning on the balloon. This would have done better for me if it were outside with a nice sky (maybe weather didn''t permit??)</td>', 'I like the balloon since we usually see yellow smileys so the red is a cool change. The sky looks more like a picture of sky instead of an actual sky, and its too blurry imo. It also looks like you burned in some spots on the clouds and got some of that burning on the balloon. This would have done better for me if it were outside with a nice sky (maybe weather didn''t permit??)', '2010-04-19 23:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956830, 868961, 28882, '<td valign="top">the set-up is nice and this is quite creative.  there is something weird going on with the white background on my screen,  kinda splotchy</td>', 'the set-up is nice and this is quite creative.  there is something weird going on with the white background on my screen,  kinda splotchy', '2010-04-19 23:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
