(5956838, 869699, 28882, '<td valign="top">i like this image though i don''t normally like the selective desat. thing.  (even though i actually used it on mine this time.) :)</td>', 'i like this image though i don''t normally like the selective desat. thing.  (even though i actually used it on mine this time.) :)', '2010-04-19 23:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
