(5956870, 869461, 61971, '<td valign="top">Well, I don''t know where to start. Technically not a bad picture. The lighting and composition are nice. Subject matter does nothing for me though and is pretty offensive although unique. Good Luck to you.</td>', 'Well, I don''t know where to start. Technically not a bad picture. The lighting and composition are nice. Subject matter does nothing for me though and is pretty offensive although unique. Good Luck to you.', '2010-04-20 00:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
