(5956913, 867499, 115307, '<td valign="top">Emotionally powerful image. Very well done.<br/>You have put meaning into your photo where others have only managed to capture a pretty scene.</td>', 'Emotionally powerful image. Very well done.You have put meaning into your photo where others have only managed to capture a pretty scene.', '2010-04-20 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956919, 869466, 115307, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. This made me smile.<br/>For such a good idea, I think you could have drawn the face a little less hastily. Or at least that is how it appears.</td>', 'Nice idea. This made me smile.For such a good idea, I think you could have drawn the face a little less hastily. Or at least that is how it appears.', '2010-04-20 00:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956920, 868110, 25313, '<td valign="top">there is no doubt this is a balloon. the bird turn around would have been perfect. 7</td>', 'there is no doubt this is a balloon. the bird turn around would have been perfect. 7', '2010-04-20 00:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956925, 869960, 25313, '<td valign="top">i like the humor. 7</td>', 'i like the humor. 7', '2010-04-20 00:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956927, 870063, 61971, '<td valign="top">The uninflated idea is unique, but I can''t decide if the blur/focus is a good thing or distracting. I find myself looking at the blur instead of the one in focus. Maybe its because the left side seems extra blurry. I think it would have appealed to me more with the left side cropped out (more a of a square crop around the in focus balloon), a nice border, and a tad brighter.</td>', 'The uninflated idea is unique, but I can''t decide if the blur/focus is a good thing or distracting. I find myself looking at the blur instead of the one in focus. Maybe its because the left side seems extra blurry. I think it would have appealed to me more with the left side cropped out (more a of a square crop around the in focus balloon), a nice border, and a tad brighter.', '2010-04-20 00:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956929, 868875, 25313, '<td valign="top">maybe a bit more foreground and space. 6</td>', 'maybe a bit more foreground and space. 6', '2010-04-20 00:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956932, 867649, 115307, '<td valign="top">Too cute ^_^<br/>Love the movie, and love this photo</td>', 'Too cute ^_^Love the movie, and love this photo', '2010-04-20 00:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5956934, 869442, 115307, '<td valign="top">The title of this greatly improves the image. I was going to vote, then saw the title, and am bumping the initial score up by one.</td>', 'The title of this greatly improves the image. I was going to vote, then saw the title, and am bumping the initial score up by one.', '2010-04-20 00:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
