(5959156, 869634, 61971, '<td valign="top">This was a cute idea, but the colors in the couch and the overall darkness of the girl doesn''t fit the concept imo. Also, she seems out of focus. Shooting with a bigger number on the aperture setting would have helped get her in focus. I would have had her wear something light colored as well.</td>', 'This was a cute idea, but the colors in the couch and the overall darkness of the girl doesn''t fit the concept imo. Also, she seems out of focus. Shooting with a bigger number on the aperture setting would have helped get her in focus. I would have had her wear something light colored as well.', '2010-04-21 00:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5959159, 869609, 61971, '<td valign="top">Very pretty model, great focus on the eyes. I feel this would have been better in color, with her facing forward (still looking up) with the ribbons, and the balloons being more prominent in the photo.</td>', 'Very pretty model, great focus on the eyes. I feel this would have been better in color, with her facing forward (still looking up) with the ribbons, and the balloons being more prominent in the photo.', '2010-04-21 00:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5959167, 867799, 61971, '<td valign="top">Imho there are too many special effect components to this, which is distracting to me. I think this would be better for me without the light traces.</td>', 'Imho there are too many special effect components to this, which is distracting to me. I think this would be better for me without the light traces.', '2010-04-21 00:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5959174, 868059, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the texture and focus. Even thought the yellow is a bright lemon color the overall feeling for me is that it is flat for lighting. I Think changing the background from blue to a purple would have helped a little bit.</td>', 'I like the texture and focus. Even thought the yellow is a bright lemon color the overall feeling for me is that it is flat for lighting. I Think changing the background from blue to a purple would have helped a little bit.', '2010-04-21 00:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
