(5962837, 869436, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like this unique idea. Good perspective. The big yellow part in the middle of the balloons is a bit distracting imo.</td>', 'I like this unique idea. Good perspective. The big yellow part in the middle of the balloons is a bit distracting imo.', '2010-04-22 00:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962842, 869855, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the composition for this and how awesome it must have been to get on this ride during a balloon challenge! :) For me it would have been better if the balloon that is in the bottom right corner where the one you were closest to since it looks like it has some brighter colors in it.</td>', 'I like the composition for this and how awesome it must have been to get on this ride during a balloon challenge! :) For me it would have been better if the balloon that is in the bottom right corner where the one you were closest to since it looks like it has some brighter colors in it.', '2010-04-22 00:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962852, 869935, 61971, '<td valign="top">I am so glad that I decided to go back through and comment on all my lower scored pictures. On the first pass I scored this a 4. When I came back to this I stopped for a minute to decide what I wanted to say and thought "Wow, I really like this!" Just thought I would share lol.<br/> <br/>I don''t get the title though, it sounds like a creepy movie (maybe it was meant to) But for the picture I love this DOF, The texture in the rocks is really nice. I like the dark feel against the pretty yellow smiley face. The mountain in the background makes for nice composition. Bumping to an 8</td>', 'I am so glad that I decided to go back through and comment on all my lower scored pictures. On the first pass I scored this a 4. When I came back to this I stopped for a minute to decide what I wanted to say and thought "Wow, I really like this!" Just thought I would share lol. I don''t get the title though, it sounds like a creepy movie (maybe it was meant to) But for the picture I love this DOF, The texture in the rocks is really nice. I like the dark feel against the pretty yellow smiley face. The mountain in the background makes for nice composition. Bumping to an 8', '2010-04-22 00:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962858, 869063, 94614, '<td valign="top">so cool! :)</td>', 'so cool! :)', '2010-04-22 00:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962862, 867774, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, and the use of different balloons, dof is ok too. I know the cactus has to be part of the story, but it really just looks out of place imo. I would have gotten the "dont need any friends" title even if you had just the balloons since the alien balloon is not smiling and is well alien :)</td>', 'I like the lighting, and the use of different balloons, dof is ok too. I know the cactus has to be part of the story, but it really just looks out of place imo. I would have gotten the "dont need any friends" title even if you had just the balloons since the alien balloon is not smiling and is well alien :)', '2010-04-22 00:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962864, 868875, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but would be good to see a bit more light on the boy.</td>', 'Good idea, but would be good to see a bit more light on the boy.', '2010-04-22 00:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962868, 869575, 42495, '<td valign="top">I''m normally not a big fan of selective desat, but it works well here and you''ve captured quite the expression.</td>', 'I''m normally not a big fan of selective desat, but it works well here and you''ve captured quite the expression.', '2010-04-22 00:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
