(5963597, 869064, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept and composition. I wish the child stood out from the background just a little bit more. She''s so ''lost'' I almost missed her. My eye went right to the yellow balloon, but then searched around and around the rest of the image trying to distinguish what I was seeing. The contrast may be a little too extreme.</td>', 'Very nice concept and composition. I wish the child stood out from the background just a little bit more. She''s so ''lost'' I almost missed her. My eye went right to the yellow balloon, but then searched around and around the rest of the image trying to distinguish what I was seeing. The contrast may be a little too extreme.', '2010-04-22 13:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5963599, 867880, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the shimmer.</td>', 'I like the shimmer.', '2010-04-22 14:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5963609, 868019, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and idea for the challenge. I like it a lot, but can''t give it a 10 because the processing is so extreme that there is a red fringe along her pants, a white (oversharpened) edge along the rest of the silhouette, and her hair looks like thick strands of yarn.</td>', 'Nice composition and idea for the challenge. I like it a lot, but can''t give it a 10 because the processing is so extreme that there is a red fringe along her pants, a white (oversharpened) edge along the rest of the silhouette, and her hair looks like thick strands of yarn.', '2010-04-22 14:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5963655, 869787, 113278, '<td valign="top">Oohhh... I really, really, REALLY LOVE this shot. Awesome stuff. One of my top 3 picks for the challenge.</td>', 'Oohhh... I really, really, REALLY LOVE this shot. Awesome stuff. One of my top 3 picks for the challenge.', '2010-04-22 14:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
