(5968188, 868932, 99708, '<td valign="top">I love the portion of the shot through the mirror.  Unfortunately, the window is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I love the portion of the shot through the mirror.  Unfortunately, the window is a bit distracting.', '2010-04-25 15:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
