(5968224, 869063, 99708, '<td valign="top">Hoping that the writing is on the bg and not added text, because I like this shot.  She looks fierce!</td>', 'Hoping that the writing is on the bg and not added text, because I like this shot.  She looks fierce!', '2010-04-25 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
