(5970086, 868928, 74948, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by redjulep:</b></div><hr/><i> This is terrible, and that poor dog. Think twice next time you use your animal friend for an image by putting things on its head. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Number one: during this photo I was playing with her and she was trying to eat the easter grass<br/> <br/>Number two: at 6 months old she had caught Parvo and survived, she''s also survived being hit by<br/>            a car twice due to my old neighbors son flying around a corner at a high speed in<br/>            the middle of the night with not headlights on.<br/> <br/>Number three: She will attack water and snowballs and roll around in the dirt getting a bunch<br/>              of stuff on her<br/> <br/>Number four: As for me needing to think twice, then maybe those people who put those silly dog<br/>             clothes on need to think twice also. At least she ain''t dressed up in some stupid<br/>             costume.<br/> <br/>Oh and finally back off she is 15 years old and still thinks she is a puppy, and I didn''t put it on her head she dug her head under it then lifted her head. <br/> <br/>Maybe your the one that needs to think twice before you assume shit.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-04-26 01:16:38.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by redjulep: This is terrible, and that poor dog. Think twice next time you use your animal friend for an image by putting things on its head.   Number one: during this photo I was playing with her and she was trying to eat the easter grass Number two: at 6 months old she had caught Parvo and survived, she''s also survived being hit by            a car twice due to my old neighbors son flying around a corner at a high speed in            the middle of the night with not headlights on. Number three: She will attack water and snowballs and roll around in the dirt getting a bunch              of stuff on her Number four: As for me needing to think twice, then maybe those people who put those silly dog             clothes on need to think twice also. At least she ain''t dressed up in some stupid             costume. Oh and finally back off she is 15 years old and still thinks she is a puppy, and I didn''t put it on her head she dug her head under it then lifted her head.  Maybe your the one that needs to think twice before you assume shit.', '2010-04-26 02:14:59.000000', '2010-04-26 02:16:38.000000', 0),
