(5970648, 868655, 90495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by giantmike:</b></div><hr/><i> Best popping shot I have seen thus far. The added complexity of having two darts pass through, and a nice fast shutter speed makes thins one really stand out. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>She could have taken this at 1/8th of a second or even at 2 minutes. It''s the flash that freezes the movement, not the shutter''s speed.<br/> <br/>Great capture Judi. Glad it did well, all you anti popping balloons people could shut up now. :) 15 of those voted this below 5. Those are people who just don''t like ANY water shot no matter how well it''s done. That''s what I consider a troll.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-04-26 07:37:02.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by giantmike: Best popping shot I have seen thus far. The added complexity of having two darts pass through, and a nice fast shutter speed makes thins one really stand out.   She could have taken this at 1/8th of a second or even at 2 minutes. It''s the flash that freezes the movement, not the shutter''s speed. Great capture Judi. Glad it did well, all you anti popping balloons people could shut up now. :) 15 of those voted this below 5. Those are people who just don''t like ANY water shot no matter how well it''s done. That''s what I consider a troll.', '2010-04-26 08:34:10.000000', '2010-04-26 08:37:02.000000', 0),
