(5975607, 870154, 79720, '<td valign="top">Wow, you got no comments during the challenge...that sort of sucks.<br/> <br/>I think a couple of things did you in on this image, first of all was the dimensions. You''re allowed up to 800px (could be a sqaure, if you wanted)...you should use ''em all. Next, there''s no context to your hand...it''s looks disjointed from your body in the background. And lastly, that sneer...balloons can be fun, or melancholy, or colourful, but they shouldn''t make you <i>mad</i>. Hope I''m not being too harsh.<br/> <br/>David</td>', 'Wow, you got no comments during the challenge...that sort of sucks. I think a couple of things did you in on this image, first of all was the dimensions. You''re allowed up to 800px (could be a sqaure, if you wanted)...you should use ''em all. Next, there''s no context to your hand...it''s looks disjointed from your body in the background. And lastly, that sneer...balloons can be fun, or melancholy, or colourful, but they shouldn''t make you mad. Hope I''m not being too harsh. David', '2010-04-28 00:01:29.000000', NULL, 0),
