(5978938, 868925, 59029, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I agree with too much turf showing below.  It looks like a landscape shot with the child/balloons as almost an afterthought.  A lower pof would have added a sense of dynamism.<br/> <br/>ETA: if it''s his birthday...well, could have a picnic table set up with a cake/party settings, extra kids etc.  Just a thought.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-04-29 09:38:28.</i></td>', 'Hmm, I agree with too much turf showing below.  It looks like a landscape shot with the child/balloons as almost an afterthought.  A lower pof would have added a sense of dynamism. ETA: if it''s his birthday...well, could have a picnic table set up with a cake/party settings, extra kids etc.  Just a thought.', '2010-04-29 10:37:14.000000', '2010-04-29 10:38:28.000000', 0),
(5979288, 868925, 70270, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 7 ... loved the set up and toning, figured you had either cloned out a step ladder or had the subject jump off a platform out of the frame.  The inability to see his face or any expression that would have furthered the story you''re telling here is what stopped it from going higher (along with the fact that there were a ton of great images in this challenge, and I always tend, subconciously at least, to grade on a curve).</td>', 'I gave you a 7 ... loved the set up and toning, figured you had either cloned out a step ladder or had the subject jump off a platform out of the frame.  The inability to see his face or any expression that would have furthered the story you''re telling here is what stopped it from going higher (along with the fact that there were a ton of great images in this challenge, and I always tend, subconciously at least, to grade on a curve).', '2010-04-29 13:14:41.000000', NULL, 0),
