(5979967, 869949, 59029, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous shot, Svetlana!  Love the balloons, the lighting and makeup...just wonderful.  So good to have you back, especially in the top 10 where you belong. ((HUGS)) Susan</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous shot, Svetlana!  Love the balloons, the lighting and makeup...just wonderful.  So good to have you back, especially in the top 10 where you belong. ((HUGS)) Susan', '2010-04-29 21:42:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5979970, 869787, 59029, '<td valign="top">This shot is so twisted, funny and cute all at the same time.   Well deserves the 9 I gave you in voting.  Reminds me of a Tim Burton movie, looks like Edward Scissorhands'' younger, not-Scissorhanded kid sister.  Hilarious!  I figured it would be too dark a shot to ribbon this time, but still, huge congrats on the top 10 finish.</td>', 'This shot is so twisted, funny and cute all at the same time.   Well deserves the 9 I gave you in voting.  Reminds me of a Tim Burton movie, looks like Edward Scissorhands'' younger, not-Scissorhanded kid sister.  Hilarious!  I figured it would be too dark a shot to ribbon this time, but still, huge congrats on the top 10 finish.', '2010-04-29 21:45:49.000000', NULL, 0),
