(5992984, 869575, 67145, '<td valign="top">WOW SOFIA . !!<br/>this is fantastic .. i love the b&amp;w with that bright red balloon . i love keely''s nearly lost/sad/far away expression .. i love the background with the trees and the long grass .. almost like a fairy tale or something .. congrats on an awesome pic .. i bet she loves it ... would look amazing printed .. :)</td>', 'WOW SOFIA . !!this is fantastic .. i love the b&w with that bright red balloon . i love keely''s nearly lost/sad/far away expression .. i love the background with the trees and the long grass .. almost like a fairy tale or something .. congrats on an awesome pic .. i bet she loves it ... would look amazing printed .. :)', '2010-05-05 20:16:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5995419, 868655, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jac:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by giantmike:</b></div><hr/><i> Best popping shot I have seen thus far. The added complexity of having two darts pass through, and a nice fast shutter speed makes thins one really stand out. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>She could have taken this at 1/8th of a second or even at 2 minutes. It''s the flash that freezes the movement, not the shutter''s speed.<br/> <br/>Great capture Judi. Glad it did well, all you anti popping balloons people could shut up now. :) 15 of those voted this below 5. Those are people who just don''t like ANY water shot no matter how well it''s done. That''s what I consider a troll. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I didn''t use a flash.</td>', 'Originally posted by Jac: Originally posted by giantmike: Best popping shot I have seen thus far. The added complexity of having two darts pass through, and a nice fast shutter speed makes thins one really stand out.   She could have taken this at 1/8th of a second or even at 2 minutes. It''s the flash that freezes the movement, not the shutter''s speed. Great capture Judi. Glad it did well, all you anti popping balloons people could shut up now. :) 15 of those voted this below 5. Those are people who just don''t like ANY water shot no matter how well it''s done. That''s what I consider a troll.   I didn''t use a flash.', '2010-05-07 09:03:49.000000', NULL, 0),
