(6006867, 869630, 114969, '<td valign="top">They sky was plain blue as it was shot in the middle of afternoon, the pastel tones were added in post-processing.<br/>As for my wife standing above the water, I placed a stool just under her feet, just below the water level.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments!</td>', 'They sky was plain blue as it was shot in the middle of afternoon, the pastel tones were added in post-processing.As for my wife standing above the water, I placed a stool just under her feet, just below the water level. Thanks for all the comments!', '2010-05-14 09:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6012040, 869479, 90624, '<td valign="top">UN REAL.. amazing. I would do a whole series like this if I had the ability to shoot them. Wow!! Did you use water in them and were they varied?</td>', 'UN REAL.. amazing. I would do a whole series like this if I had the ability to shoot them. Wow!! Did you use water in them and were they varied?', '2010-05-17 22:51:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6016732, 869479, 65858, '<td valign="top">Hey, thanks for the comments, folks - just noticed them.<br/> <br/>Yes, these are water balloons dropped onto a tile floor using flashes to freeze the motion.  They''re really pretty tough if you don''t overfill them - I only had one break on accident.  The "vomiting pacman" was on purpose - if you look closely you can see the pin on the floor.  The only thing I varied over the other shots was exactly when the flash trigger went off during the impact.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the suggestions, Joe.  =)</td>', 'Hey, thanks for the comments, folks - just noticed them. Yes, these are water balloons dropped onto a tile floor using flashes to freeze the motion.  They''re really pretty tough if you don''t overfill them - I only had one break on accident.  The "vomiting pacman" was on purpose - if you look closely you can see the pin on the floor.  The only thing I varied over the other shots was exactly when the flash trigger went off during the impact. Thanks for the suggestions, Joe.  =)', '2010-05-19 17:08:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6017266, 870032, 52115, '<td valign="top">I pulled the trigger on this one. This should have done better. Maybe you should''ve entered the shot of me with the smiley face balloon as my head. There were a few others like that.</td>', 'I pulled the trigger on this one. This should have done better. Maybe you should''ve entered the shot of me with the smiley face balloon as my head. There were a few others like that.', '2010-05-19 21:18:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6023740, 869512, 64844, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful!</td>', 'The colors are beautiful!', '2010-05-24 08:38:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6023858, 868703, 43463, '<td valign="top">Long time overdue in commenting; (Hello Neighbor...your entry is right above mine). The idea and execution in this composition is minimalistic and very well done. Color choice was great. The red really pops (sorry for using that term as we are talking balloons here:-) ) off the black backdrop. Love how you also composed the balloon to come out at the diagonal for it adds visual interest. And wonderful idea to have the flame jet coming out such that it makes you think of the big hot air balloons; the small, simple object can project the idea of the larger, complex object. Great job!</td>', 'Long time overdue in commenting; (Hello Neighbor...your entry is right above mine). The idea and execution in this composition is minimalistic and very well done. Color choice was great. The red really pops (sorry for using that term as we are talking balloons here:-) ) off the black backdrop. Love how you also composed the balloon to come out at the diagonal for it adds visual interest. And wonderful idea to have the flame jet coming out such that it makes you think of the big hot air balloons; the small, simple object can project the idea of the larger, complex object. Great job!', '2010-05-24 10:20:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6024036, 869774, 86447, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2010-05-24 12:17:04.000000', NULL, 0),
