(6025462, 869400, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wow, I have the honor of leaving you the first comment.  This looks like a perfect way to celebrate the day.  Wish I could still jump like that lol.  Love all the colors!</td>', 'Wow, I have the honor of leaving you the first comment.  This looks like a perfect way to celebrate the day.  Wish I could still jump like that lol.  Love all the colors!', '2010-05-25 09:35:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6026393, 868785, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great idea colour and contrast. The basic shades of yellow on blue work a treat and the fact that your model has her eyes closed emphasizes the fact that she has to put some effort into blowing these types of bubbles! The processing and border add nicely. More than happy to be sharing a placing beside you. Well done.</td>', 'Great idea colour and contrast. The basic shades of yellow on blue work a treat and the fact that your model has her eyes closed emphasizes the fact that she has to put some effort into blowing these types of bubbles! The processing and border add nicely. More than happy to be sharing a placing beside you. Well done.', '2010-05-25 22:23:16.000000', NULL, 0),
