(6251579, 868288, 103142, '<td valign="top">So... I''m an avid user of your scores plug-in, but I had a suggestion, so I looked at the preferences to see if it was already there and implemented. Then I saw that it was fav-ware--I didn''t realize that!<br/> <br/>This one was easy to fav -- it''s such a great photo and it''s so intriguing! Nicely done!</td>', 'So... I''m an avid user of your scores plug-in, but I had a suggestion, so I looked at the preferences to see if it was already there and implemented. Then I saw that it was fav-ware--I didn''t realize that! This one was easy to fav -- it''s such a great photo and it''s so intriguing! Nicely done!', '2010-12-12 09:53:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6260863, 869252, 54645, '<td valign="top">Actually I like the balloon in BW, it''s the the grass that popped it''s thunder. The tones in the grass became to homogeneous, and in some areas muddy. If you had preserved the in focus texture, and background blur it would have had more of an impact...still like the balloon.</td>', 'Actually I like the balloon in BW, it''s the the grass that popped it''s thunder. The tones in the grass became to homogeneous, and in some areas muddy. If you had preserved the in focus texture, and background blur it would have had more of an impact...still like the balloon.', '2010-12-24 10:39:14.000000', NULL, 0),
